# Gate-2 §10: evidence is NEVER part of the source candidate it describes.
# Everything under evidence/ is produced by RUNNING the frozen source candidate,
# so it is absent from the source commit and recorded afterwards in a separate
# evidence-attestation commit (which tracks it explicitly). It is intentionally
# NOT ignored here — ignoring it would prevent that attestation.
